    "source_answer": "A",
    "previous_model_response": "Because the triangle is isosceles, the altitude from the vertex also bisects the base, creating a right triangle with hypotenuse \\(32\\) and angle \\(54^\\circ\\).\n\n\\[\n\\sin(54^\\circ)=\\frac{x}{32}\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx=32\\sin(54^\\circ)\\approx 25.9\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the answer is C: 25.9."
  },
